flowchart TD
    Q[Define a measurable question] --> M[Mockserver: same role journeys]
    Q --> A[API / Playwright: freeze app, requirements and model settings]
    Q --> W[QA workflow: same tasks, helpers, source and budget]
    W --> WB[Baseline repository discovery]
    W --> WC[Framework instructions, skill and context resolver]
    WB --> WL[Read, edit or decide, verify and repair]
    WC --> WL
    WL --> WG[Independent task grading and pending semantic review]
    WG --> E
    Q --> J[Decision models: coverage and smoke pilot]
    M --> MB[Legacy interception vs role-aware mockserver]
    MB --> MO[Role assertions and setup / journey runtime]
    A --> L[Select one runtime: cloud Codex or local llama.cpp]
    L --> B[Baseline: plain runner + app source]
    L --> F[Framework: same inputs + existing helpers and conventions]
    B --> G[Fresh model response: 3 repeats per arm]
    F --> G
    G --> O[Unchanged tests: healthy app + activated hidden faults]
    O --> T[Completion, quality checks, time and tokens]
    J --> JO[Review findings vs gold labels]
    JO --> JM[Precision, recall, missed issues, false alarms]
    MO --> E[Private raw evidence and source hashes]
    T --> E
    JM --> E
    E --> V[Validate identities, denominators and public schema]
    V --> P[Publish aggregates to GitHub results branches]
    P --> D[Deployed Netlify dashboard refreshes feeds]
    T -. separate human review needed .-> H[Human correction timer: currently unmeasured]
    T -. standard API rates .-> C[API-equivalent estimate: not actual billed spend]
